      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A good name for this would be \"Others Local Only\".\n\nIt adds a new checkbox to the Contact Receiver UI that, when enabled, allows the contact to be triggered only by other users, and the resulting effect is shown only to them. The avatar wearer and everyone else won’t see anything—it’s fully local to the person interacting.\n\nThis should stay as a separate checkbox rather than being merged into a three-way mode with \"Local Only\", because you might want to use both at the same time—for example, showing one effect to yourself when you touch something, and a completely different effect to others when they touch it.\n\nJust keep in mind: enabling \"Others Local Only\" will still create a local contact on every other player’s client, so it does affect performance rank, similar to \"Local Only\". Even if you disable \"Local Only\", the performance benefit is undone if \"Others Local Only\" is on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
