  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently for contacts there's Local and non-Local\n\nI want a third in between option\n\nWhere it isn't local but also isn't synced over the network to other players or the player using the avatar\n\nAn example goal: \"When another user touches a spot (like a button or your hand), it triggers an animation only visible to them.\"",
